      "content": "To heighten the tension authentically, the language should reflect entrenched institutional bias rather than mere anger. Instead of broad slurs, they might speak with frustrated certainty about maintaining control, perhaps saying, \"We built this town on a certain way of life, Jimmie, and this integration talk is just trying to tear the foundation out from under us.\" Dale could retort, \"This ain't about fairness; it's about who runs things, and we can't let some outsiders change the structure we know.\"",
